=== TASK 3 intermediate (stale harness served pre-fix code): 5x500 ===
successes=0 of=5, 5x 500:INTERNAL_ERROR, redemption-rows=0 for the new code.
Cause found via probe: Prisma $queryRaw cannot deserialize void columns
(`pg_advisory_xact_lock` returns void) — switched to $executeRaw (returns
row count). Lesson: restart the throwaway harness after every backend edit;
a stale harness serves pre-fix code and produces false signals.

